title: Design Grammar ontology
message: >-
  If you use this ontology or the accompanying software, please cite it using
  the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Evgenii
    family-names: Ermolenko
    email: erarchitech@gmail.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0003-1228-9550'
    affiliation: >-
      University of Minho; EAAD; Lab2PT; ISISE, Guimaraes, Portugal
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Erarchitech/design-grammar-ontology'
abstract: >-
  The Design Grammar ontology: a vendor-neutral core module over five coplanar
  graph layers, with alignment extensions to the W3C/OGC standards stack, the
  Building Topology Ontology and Topologic, a SHACL shape set, the normative
  property-graph-to-OWL mapping, and the runtime services that exercise the
  schema.
keywords:
  - ontology
  - knowledge graph
  - SWRL
  - SHACL
  - design intent
  - openBIM
  - compliance checking
  - design grammars
